at could confirm a match.\",\n        \"section\": \"Introduction, Evaluation designs (Table 1) and Analysis (Expert human versus GPT-4 judge)\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"summary\": \"All reported numbers, qualificafigures:\ndesign_scores.pdf\ndesign_scores.pdf.prov.json\ndesign_scores.png\ndesign_scores.png.prov.json\noverview_protocol.pdf\noverview_protocol.png\noverview_protocol.prompts.json\n\nscientific-evidence:\nbundle.manifest.json\nledger.jsonl\nschemas\nspec.md\nverification-report.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
